    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: be6b1fd2ca8b333ee1bc48c0a8b33bfe7a9e84d0 -->\nReady for the maintainer to merge. No blocking findings.\n\nI read the complete four-file diff and issue #3865. I checked the current rules from `upstream/main:AGENTS.md`.\n\nThe new error reports a busy window with exit code 4. The existing tests still verify stale files and refused tokens. The help text lists the new exit code.\n\nResults from the local trial merge:\n\n- PR head: `be6b1fd2ca8b333ee1bc48c0a8b33bfe7a9e84d0`.\n- Main base: `9adabbb84ce8ae89decbf5453270bacc139f9efd`.\n- Trial merge: `6f322b4c49dfabcd2568d06e65ffcb2f33b3ec3a`. Its first parent is the PR head.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 3 steps passed, 0 failed.\n- App build: `--no-run --lib --test mcp_live` passed.\n- App library: 306 passed, 0 failed.\n- `mcp_live`: 20 passed, 0 failed. This includes `ui_link::a_second_ui_call_during_a_slow_call_reports_busy_and_exits_4`.\n- `CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 RUSTC_WRAPPER=sccache cargo clippy -j 16 -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\n\nExtra suites run: none. The diff changes no fixtures, importers, posts, operations, motion, or catalog files.\n\nSafety tier: not required. The diff changes no posted G-code, geometry, stock simulation, gouge checks, or collision checks. Mutations were not required or run. No goldens moved.\n\nThe new test holds an idle socket session open. I did not run a live GUI command. No `crates/ui` code changed, so before/after screenshots are not required.\n\nRequested before merge: none.\n\nThe review worktree and branch remain in place to retain the build cache. No code was changed or pushed.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
